# Optional: MapTiler Cloud key for hybrid satellite + terrain-rgb tiles.
# Without it, PeakAtlas3D falls back to free Sentinel-2 imagery (EOX) +
# Mapterhorn DEM — enough for local/CI, but MapTiler looks closer to the
# previous Mapbox satellite-streets experience.
#
# Create a key at https://cloud.maptiler.com/account/keys/
VITE_MAPTILER_KEY=
